    "chunk_text": "\u00f0 israhel hera\u00f0 & oferblissa\u00f0 hine on worulda Benedicat Israhel domino laudet et Sacerdas Benedicite sacerdotus domini domino. Bletsia\u00f0 \u00f0eowan drihtnes drihtne benedicite serui domini domino. Gast & sawle rihtwisra drihtne Benedicite spiritus et anim\u00eb iustorum domino. Bletsia\u00f0 halgan & eadmodan heortan drihtne benedicite sancti et humiles corde domino. Bletsia\u00f0 annania azaria misahel drihtne hera\u00f0 & oferblissa\u00f0 hine on worulda bletsion we f\u00e6der & Sy gebletson drihten god for\u00f0on he neosode & he dyde alysednysse folces his Benedictus dominus & ar\u00e6rde horn h\u00e6lo us on huse dauides cnihtes his Et erexit cornu salutis nobis in domo Dauid Swaswa he spr\u00e6c \u00feurh mu\u00f0 haligra \u00fee fram worulde w\u00e6ron witegena his Sicut locutus est per os H\u00e6l of feondum urum & of handa ealra \u00fea \u00f0e hatudon us Salutem ex inimicis nostris et de manu To donne mildheortnysse mid f\u00e6derum urum & gemunan gecy\u00f0nysse his halgan Ad faciendam A\u00f0swering \u00feone he swor to habrahame f\u00e6der urum to sellanne hine us Iusiurandum quod iurauit ad \u00de\u00e6t buton ege of handa feonda ura alysde we \u00f0eowian him Vt sine timore de manu inimicorum Gemicla\u00f0 sawle min drihten Magnificat anima mea dominum. & gef\u00e6gnode gast min on god h\u00e6lo min Et exultauit spiritus meus in deo salutari meo. For\u00f0on beheold eadmodnysse \u00f0innenne hyre efne so\u00f0lice heononfor\u00f0 eadige me secga\u00f0 ealle",
